WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.015 --> 00:00:05.066
A few years passed.

2
00:00:05.067 --> 00:00:09.151
One morning Rapunzel was in her room.

3
00:00:09.152 --> 00:00:12.598
She was writing a letter.

4
00:00:12.599 --> 00:00:15.417
Dear Mama and Papa,

5
00:00:15.418 --> 00:00:19.318
The witch is mean, but I am fine.

6
00:00:19.319 --> 00:00:23.081
I like to help in the garden.

7
00:00:23.082 --> 00:00:26.844
I like to mix potions for her too.

8
00:00:26.845 --> 00:00:30.487
The witch says magic words over the potions.

9
00:00:30.488 --> 00:00:35.984
But she will not teach me magic.

10
00:00:35.985 --> 00:00:41.291
Ha! Maybe she's afraid I'll put a spell on her!

11
00:00:41.292 --> 00:00:45.653
Every week we go to the market to sell potions.

12
00:00:45.654 --> 00:00:49.307
Sometimes the king's servant visits us.

13
00:00:49.308 --> 00:00:53.639
He comes for hair potion.

14
00:00:53.640 --> 00:01:01.115
The king does not want to go bald!

15
00:01:01.116 --> 00:01:03.917
I will be 13 soon.

16
00:01:03.918 --> 00:01:07.157
The witch thinks I forgot about you.

17
00:01:07.158 --> 00:01:09.867
But I never will!

18
00:01:09.868 --> 00:01:15.411
Love, Rapunzel

19
00:01:15.412 --> 00:01:19.856
Rapunzel sighed.

20
00:01:19.857 --> 00:01:23.508
She wrote to her parents every week.

21
00:01:23.509 --> 00:01:27.335
But there was no way to send the letters.

22
00:01:27.336 --> 00:01:31.947
So she just ripped them up.

23
00:01:31.948 --> 00:01:36.863
Once the witch saw Rapunzel writing a letter.

24
00:01:36.864 --> 00:01:40.095
She snatched it away from her.

25
00:01:40.096 --> 00:01:45.469
Then she locked Rapunzel in her room for a week.

26
00:01:45.470 --> 00:01:49.042
Rapunzel ripped up the newest letter.

27
00:01:49.043 --> 00:01:52.856
"Someday I will escape," she thought.

28
00:01:52.857 --> 00:01:56.330
"Someday I will go home again."

29
00:01:56.331 --> 00:01:59.744
Suddenly she heard a shout from the hall.

30
00:01:59.745 --> 00:02:03.184
"A hedgehog!" the witch yelled.

31
00:02:03.185 --> 00:02:05.277
"It's in the house!

32
00:02:05.278 --> 00:02:08.239
I hate hedgehogs!"

33
00:02:08.240 --> 00:02:11.012
Rapunzel gasped.

34
00:02:11.013 --> 00:02:13.859
"Oh no! Prickle!" she thought.

35
00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:16.174
"The witch found him!"

36
00:02:16.175 --> 00:02:19.939
She ran into the hall.

37
00:02:19.940 --> 00:02:22.841
The witch was looking around.

38
00:02:22.842 --> 00:02:25.825
"I saw a hedgehog.

39
00:02:25.826 --> 00:02:28.316
It is hiding somewhere.

40
00:02:28.317 --> 00:02:32.060
Rapunzel, help me find it!"

41
00:02:32.061 --> 00:02:35.377
Rapunzel ran to one end of the hall.

42
00:02:35.378 --> 00:02:39.259
The witch went the other way.

43
00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:43.553
"Prickle?" Rapunzel whispered.

44
00:02:43.554 --> 00:02:47.453
Something nearby moved.

45
00:02:47.454 --> 00:02:50.658
It was Prickle.

46
00:02:50.659 --> 00:02:54.694
He dashed into a nearby room.

47
00:02:54.695 --> 00:02:59.814
Rapunzel gulped. "Oh no!"

48
00:02:59.815 --> 00:03:04.267
Prickle was in the library!

